{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","狂野狙击"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","ワイルドシューティング"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","进行一段冲刺，随后向一个方向发射强力穿透箭。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","突進し、指定方向に強力な貫通の矢を放つ"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","跳到目标格子处，短暂蓄力后向所选方向发射一支强力穿透箭，对1格宽路径上的所有敌人造成280% + 30% ATK伤害和2秒眩晕。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","対象マスにジャンプし、力を溜めてから、指定方向に強力な貫通の矢を1本放つ。1マス幅の軌道上にいる敵に280% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、2秒間のスタンを付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":50,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが300% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本技能击中敌人时，还会在敌人位置引发“炽热赠礼”的爆炸效果，造成“炽热赠礼”技能75%的伤害。每次释放终极技能，每名敌人最多只会通过这种方式受到3次“炽热赠礼”的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","このスキルが敵にヒットすると、敵の位置に「スコーチングギフト」の爆発効果を発動し、「スコーチングギフト」の75%のダメージを与える。1回の必殺技につき、同じ敵が受ける、「スコーチングギフト」によるダメージは最大3回まで"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至320% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが320% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至340% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが340% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","甜蜜邂逅"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","スイートハプニング"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","将一个敌人击退，若后方有其他敌人则会对二者均施加效果。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵1体を後退させる。対象の後方に他の敵がいる場合、両者に同等の効果を与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","挥动鞭子，对目标造成130% + 15% ATK伤害，将其击退2格并使其定身3秒。若在目标身后一定范围内有其他敌人，则改为将目标撞向范围内最近的一名敌人，并对目标和该敌人同时造成伤害和定身效果。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","ムチを振るって、敵に130% + 15% ATKのダメージを与え、2マス後退させ、3秒間の硬直を付与。対象の後方の一定範囲内に他の敵がいる場合、その中の最も近い敵に対象をぶつけさせる。両者にダメージを与え、硬直を付与"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","若目标成功撞向了一名敌人，则还会对这两名敌人各自造成相当于对方攻击力150%的额外伤害，该伤害最高不超过阿塔兰忒300%攻击力。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","対象が他の敵1体にぶつけると、両者それぞれに相手の攻撃力×150%のダメージを追加で与える。ダメージはアタランテの攻撃力×300%を超えない"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至140% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが140% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが150% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","炽热赠礼"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","スコーチングギフト"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射一支强力爆炸箭。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","強力な爆発矢を放つ"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","向目标发射一支爆裂箭，命中后产生爆炸，对目标及其周围1格范围内的所有敌人造成190% + 20% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵に爆裂矢を放つ。ヒットすると爆発し、対象と周囲1マスの敵全体に190% + 20% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが200% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","爆炸范围扩大至2格，但在爆炸最外圈的敌人受到的伤害只有原始伤害的60%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","爆発範囲が2マスまでUPするが、爆発の最外周にいる敵へのダメージは初期ダメージの60%分になる"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが210% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，短时间内对3名不同敌人造成伤害后进一步提升急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の速度UP。初めて短時間内に異なる敵3体にダメージを与えた後、追加で自身の速度UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速。当自己在连续3秒内对3个不同的敌人造成伤害后，额外提升2点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の速度+12。初めて3秒内に異なる敵3体にダメージを与えた後、追加で自身の速度+2"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点急速。当自己在连续3秒内对3个不同的敌人造成伤害后，额外提升4点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の速度+15。初めて3秒内に異なる敵3体にダメージを与えた後、追加で自身の速度+4"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高18点急速。当自己在连续3秒内对3个不同的敌人造成伤害后，额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の速度+18。初めて3秒内に異なる敵3体にダメージを与えた後、追加で自身の速度+6"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","妙手空空"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","スリの達人"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“甜蜜邂逅”在战斗开始时可以连续释放多次。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、スキル「スイートハプニング」を複数回連続で発動することが可能"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，技能“甜蜜邂逅”可以连续使用2次，且优先对不同的目标释放。被动地，“甜蜜邂逅”造成的伤害提高6%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、スキル「スイートハプニング」を2回連続で発動することが可能。発動時は異なる対象が優先的に選択される。パッシブ効果：「スイートハプニング」のダメージ+6%"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","技能“甜蜜邂逅”的伤害加成比例提高至8%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","スキル「スイートハプニング」のダメージ上昇量が8%にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每当自己使用“甜蜜邂逅”命中主目标时，阿塔兰忒还会顺手从目标身上“借”点值钱的东西——从目标身上吸取10%攻击力和10%护甲，该效果对同一目标不可叠加。该技能吸取的属性会在8秒后归还给对方。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","自身から「スイートハプニング」を発動し、メイン対象にヒットした時、対象の攻撃力の10%と物理防御の10%を吸収する。この効果は同じ対象に対し、重複して発動しない。このスキルで吸収したステータスは、8秒後に相手に戻る"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","技能“甜蜜邂逅”的伤害加成比例提高至10%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","スキル「スイートハプニング」のダメージ上昇量が10%にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“狂野狙击”直接击中敌人时，为自身恢复生命。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","「ワイルドシューティング」が敵に直接ヒットした時、自身のHPを回復"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“狂野狙击”每直接击中一个敌人，为阿塔兰忒恢复10%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「ワイルドシューティング」が敵に直接ヒットするたびに、アタランテのHPがHP上限×10%回復"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒在释放“甜蜜邂逅”期间处于霸体状态并提升60点急速，若目标成功撞向了一名敌人，还会使这两名敌人额外降低40%的护甲，持续8秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「スイートハプニング」の発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になり、速度+60。対象が敵1体に衝突した場合、8秒間、敵2体の物理防御-40%"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","猎金弩"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","ハンターボウ"]]}